OL,3,GNEWSAFerry passengers to show ID from  
OL,4,A2027                                   
OL,6,FPassengers travelling on Isle of Man   
OL,7,FSteam Packet ferries will need to show 
OL,8,Fidentification from 2027, the Manx     
OL,9,Fgovernment has said.                   
OL,11,FThe announcement was made by Justice   
OL,12,Fand Home Affairs Minister Jane         
OL,13,FPoole-Wilson in the House of Keys on   
OL,14,FTuesday.                               
OL,16,FAsked by Glenfaba and Peel MHK Daniel  
OL,17,FDavison when identification would      
OL,18,Fbecome mandatory for ferry passengers, 
OL,19,Fshe said the requirement would come    
OL,20,Finto force next year.                  
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
