OL,3,GNEWSAFerry passengers to show ID from  
OL,4,A2027                                   
OL,6,FPoole-Wilson described the move as a   
OL,7,F"significant change" for travellers and
OL,8,Fsaid the final details would be        
OL,9,Fconfirmed by the end of the year       
OL,10,Ffollowing a public consultation.       
